    mahjong_kw("hand-selection-mahjong.html", "Hand Selection", "Mahjong hand selection — choosing the right hand on the NMJL card.", "hand selection mahjong, choose mah jongg hand", "Mahjong Hand Selection", "<p>Smart <strong>hand selection</strong> wins games — read the card, watch discards, commit early. <a href=\"mahjong-102.html\">Mahjong 102</a> · <a href=\"read-nmjl-card.html\">Read the card</a>.</p>"),
