    mahjong_kw("mahjong-card-2026.html", "2026 NMJL Card", "2026 NMJL mahjong card — new hands for the year. Learn with Lookout Mountain Mahjong.", "2026 mahjong card, nmjl card 2026, mah jongg card 2026", "2026 NMJL Mahjong Card", "<p>The <strong>2026 NMJL card</strong> brings new winning hands every year. We provide the current card at every <a href=\"mahjong-101.html\">Mahjong 101</a> lesson. <a href=\"nmjl-card.html\">NMJL guide</a> · <a href=\"read-nmjl-card.html\">Read the card</a>.</p>", priority="0.87"),
